  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Brand Connect Initiative\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Brand Connect Initiative</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 20, 2026 at 06:52 PM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/beta+drugs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Beta Drugs</a> Limited (“Beta” or “the Company”) announced that it has entered into a <a href=\"/tag/joint+venture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">joint venture</a> (“JV”) with <a href=\"/tag/imgsa+groupe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IMGSA Groupe</a> SPA (“IMGSA”), a prominent and leading pharmaceutical and medical devices company in Algeria. Beta will hold a 49% stake in the JV, with the remaining 51% held by IMGSA. The JV will acquire IMGSA’s oncology formulation plant for a total consideration of US$8.7 million. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>The plant is one of the few in Algeria that manufactures oncology formulations and has been qualified by the Algerian FDA for supply in Algerian tenders. Algeria oncology market is primarily a tender market and there has been a consistent impetus provided by the government of Algeria for localisation of pharmaceutical manufacturing. The existing product registrations of IMGSA will be transferred to the JV as part of the transaction. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <h3>A Strategic Milestone in Beta Drugs' Global Expansion</h3><p>Commenting on the proposed JV, Mr. Rahul Batra, MD, Beta Drugs Limited, stated, “Our relationship with IMGSA has grown steadily over many years, and this joint venture marks a natural next step for us to deepen our relationship and commitment to the Algerian market.\" The JV is subject to customary closing conditions. </p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Disclaimer: The above content is non-editorial, and TIL hereby disclaims any and all warranties, expressed or implied, relating to it, and does not guarantee, vouch for or necessarily endorse any of the content.</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Brand Connect Initiative</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Brand Connect Initiative</a>\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                                                                <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                    </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Nov 20, 2026 at 06:52 PM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Nov 20, 2026 at 06:52 PM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\"